			'Curated weekly digests. Email is the right medium for this — one inbox, one time slot, no infinite scroll.',
		links: [
			{
				title: 'JavaScript Weekly',
				description:
					"Peter Cooper's long-running newsletter. The default for keeping up with the JS ecosystem without doomscrolling GitHub.",
